---
import LessonShell from '../../layouts/LessonShell.astro';
---
<LessonShell
    course="LolRust"
    number={5}
    name="Repeat While"
    objective="Loop until the cat is full. Eat treats one at a time, count them, stop at the limit."
    keywords={[
        { code: 'repeat while', note: 'loop while a condition holds (while)' },
        { code: 'nap', note: 'break out of a loop' },
        { code: 'again', note: 'skip to the next iteration (continue)' },
    ]}
    initial={`iz main() {
    make wiggly treats_eaten = 0;
    make full = 8;

    // TODO: repeat while treats_eaten < full {
    //         increment treats_eaten by 1
    //         meow! the count
    //         when treats_eaten == 4, meow! a halfway message
    //       }

    meow!("I AM FULL! {} treats eaten. Time for a nap.", treats_eaten);
}`}
    checks={[
        { label: 'has while', pattern: '\\bwhile\\b' },
        { label: 'has if (from when)', pattern: '\\bif\\b' },
        { label: 'no leftover repeat while', pattern: '\\brepeat\\s+while\\b', negate: true },
        { label: 'transpiled meow!', pattern: '\\bprintln!' },
    ]}
    prev={{ href: '/lolrust/lesson-4', label: 'lesson 4' }}
    next={{ href: '/lolrust/lesson-6', label: 'lesson 6' }}
    hints={[
        '`repeat while condition { ... }` runs the body again and again until the condition is false.',
        'Inside the loop, `treats_eaten = treats_eaten + 1;` increments the counter.',
        'Use `when treats_eaten == 4 { meow!("..."); }` to print a special message at the halfway point.',
    ]}
    solution={`iz main() {
    make wiggly treats_eaten = 0;
    make full = 8;

    repeat while treats_eaten < full {
        treats_eaten = treats_eaten + 1;
        meow!("Nom nom... ate treat #{}", treats_eaten);

        when treats_eaten == 4 {
            meow!("Getting full... but I can keep going!");
        }
    }

    meow!("I AM FULL! {} treats eaten. Time for a nap.", treats_eaten);
}`}
/>
